<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Funlox Blog</title>
<style>
body { margin:0; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; background:#0f0f1f; color:#fff; line-height:1.6; }
header { background:#00ffff; color:#000; padding:25px; text-align:center; font-size:2.5rem; font-weight:bold; }
.container { padding:20px; max-width:1200px; margin:auto; }
h1, h2, h3 { color:#00ffff; margin-top:30px; }
section { background:rgba(0,255,255,0.05); padding:20px; border-radius:10px; margin-top:20px; }
.blog-post { background:rgba(255,0,255,0.1); padding:15px; border-radius:10px; margin-bottom:20px; }
.blog-post h3 { color:#ff00ff; }
.blog-post p { margin-top:10px; }
button { padding:10px 15px; border:none; border-radius:8px; background:#ff00ff; color:#000; font-weight:bold; cursor:pointer; margin-top:10px; transition:0.2s; }
button:hover { transform:scale(1.05); }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>Funlox Blog</header>

<div class="container">

    <!-- Introduction -->
    <section id="intro">
        <h1>Welcome to the Funlox Blog</h1>
        <p>Stay up to date with the latest news, updates, and community events on Funlox. Our blog features developer updates, event announcements, user highlights, and tips to enhance your Funlox experience.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Blog Posts -->
    <section id="posts">
        <div class="blog-post">
            <h3>Funlox Launch Event Coming Soon!</h3>
            <p>Date: September 10, 2025</p>
            <p>We are thrilled to announce that Funlox will officially launch next week! Join us for the opening event, explore the new worlds, and participate in fun challenges. Exciting rewards await early participants!</p>
        </div>

        <div class="blog-post">
            <h3>New Features in Funlox Studio</h3>
            <p>Date: September 3, 2025</p>
            <p>Funlox Studio has received a major update. Creators can now use advanced scripting tools, new object types, and interactive event triggers. Learn more by visiting the Funlox Learn page.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="blog-post">
            <h3>Community Spotlight: Amazing Worlds</h3>
            <p>Date: August 28, 2025</p>
            <p>This week we highlight some of the most creative worlds built by our community. From interactive obbies to mini-games, explore these fantastic creations and get inspired for your next project!</p>
        </div>

        <div class="blog-post">
            <h3>Funlox Safety Updates</h3>
            <p>Date: August 20, 2025</p>
            <p>We’ve added new safety features and reporting tools to keep the Funlox community secure. Remember to follow the community rules and report any suspicious activity through the Help & Safety page.</p>
        </div>

    </section>

    <button onclick="alert('Redirecting to Funlox Support...')">Contact Support</button>

</div>

</body>
</html>
